          "status": "accepted",
          "scope": "Only the official ThunderKittens H100 MHA dense PyTorch reference rows at sequence length 12288 on H200.",
          "decision": "Accept the tensor-core tile claim without those dense PyTorch reference rows because every selected 6144-token dense reference cell passes in fresh processes, FA3 forward/backward comparator rows cover 12288, and the remaining dense reference rows exceed practical H200 memory capacity.",
